0000036405-26-000181	RiskTextBlock	oef/2024q3	20251231	S000002844			ETFProspectus	Risk=ETFShareTradingRisk;	en-US	0	32767	3	1	1620	1109		0	ETFProspectusMember_S000002844_ETFShareTradingRiskMember	 ETF Share Trading . Vanguard ETF Shares (ETF Shares) are an exchanged-traded class of shares issued by certain Vanguard funds that represent an interest in the portfolio of securities held by the issuing fund. The Funds ETF Shares are listed for trading on NYSE Arca and individual investors may only buy and sell them on the secondary market at market prices. Although it is expected that the market price of an ETF Share typically will approximate its net asset value (NAV), there may be times when the market price of an ETF Share and its NAV differ significantly. Disruptions to creation and redemption transactions, the existence of significant market volatility, or potential lack of an active trading market for ETF Shares (including through a trading halt), as well as other factors, may result in ETF Shares trading significantly above (at a premium) or below (at a discount) the Funds NAV or the intraday value of the Funds holdings. Thus, you may pay more or less than NAV when you buy ETF Shares on the secondary market, and you may receive more or less than NAV when you sell those shares.
0000036405-26-000181	RiskTextBlock	oef/2024q3	20251231	S000002846			InstitutionalProspectus	Risk=InvestingInEquityMarketsRisk;	en-US	0	32767	3	1	597	290		0	InstitutionalProspectusMember_S000002846_InvestingInEquityMarketsRiskMember	 Investing in Equity Markets . The Fund invests in the equity markets. Equity markets have historically been cyclical, having periods of time when stock values rise and fall. Market volatility can lead to significant fluctuations in stock values, resulting in potential losses to the Fund.
0000036405-26-000181	RiskTextBlock	oef/2024q3	20251231	S000002842			InvestorProspectus	Risk=InvestingInEquityMarketsRisk;	en-US	0	32767	3	1	597	290		0	InvestorProspectusMember_S000002842_InvestingInEquityMarketsRiskMember	 Investing in Equity Markets . The Fund invests in the equity markets. Equity markets have historically been cyclical, having periods of time when stock values rise and fall. Market volatility can lead to significant fluctuations in stock values, resulting in potential losses to the Fund.
