0000036405-26-000181	RiskTextBlock	oef/2024q3	20251231	S000012756			InvestorProspectus	Risk=GrowthInvestingRisk;	en-US	0	32767	3	1	790	483		0	InvestorProspectusMember_S000012756_GrowthInvestingRiskMember	 Growth Investing . The Funds approach to growth investing could cause it to underperform other stock funds that use a different investment style. Growth stocks typically produce lower yields because growth companies prefer to reinvest earnings into research and development to promote growth and increase profitability. Research and development can be expensive and may not always produce favorable results, which could harm a companys performance relative to the broader market.
