0000036405-26-000181	RiskTextBlock	oef/2024q3	20251231	S000002840			InvestorProspectus	Risk=InvestingInEquityMarketsRisk;	en-US	0	32767	3	1	597	290		0	InvestorProspectusMember_S000002840_InvestingInEquityMarketsRiskMember	 Investing in Equity Markets . The Fund invests in the equity markets. Equity markets have historically been cyclical, having periods of time when stock values rise and fall. Market volatility can lead to significant fluctuations in stock values, resulting in potential losses to the Fund.
