0000794105-26-000106	BarChartLowestQuarterlyReturnDate	oef/2024q3	20251231	S000019554			RetailProspectus	Class=C000054349;	en-US	0	32767	3	0	10	10		0	RetailProspectusMember_S000019554_C000054349	2022-06-30
0000794105-26-000106	RiskTextBlock	oef/2024q3	20251231	S000002562			ETFProspectus	Risk=IndexInvestingRisk;	en-US	0	32767	3	1	2816	1154		0	ETFProspectusMember_S000002562_IndexInvestingRiskMember	 Index Investing . The Fund is subject to risks associated with index investing. Because the Fund generally seeks to track the performance of the Target Index regardless of how the Target Index is performing, the Funds performance may be lower than it would be if it were actively managed. Additionally, because the Fund does not hold all of the securities included in the Target Index, it is subject to the risk that the representative sample of securities selected by the advisor will, in the aggregate, vary from the investment profile of the full Target Index. The performance of the Funds investments, in the aggregate, may not match the investment performance of the Target Index . This risk, known as tracking error risk, may be heightened during times of increased market volatility or under other unusual market conditions. The Fund also could be negatively impacted by changes to the Target Index made by the index provider or by errors made by the index provider. Any gains, losses, or costs associated with or resulting from an error made by the index provider will generally be borne by the Fund and, as a result, the Funds shareholders.
0000794105-26-000106	RiskTextBlock	oef/2024q3	20251231	S000019554			InstitutionalProspectus	Risk=ActiveManagementRisk;	en-US	0	32767	3	1	653	226		0	InstitutionalProspectusMember_S000019554_ActiveManagementRiskMember	 Active Management. The Fund is actively managed. The advisors security selection and/or strategy execution could cause the Fund to underperform relevant securities markets or other funds with a similar investment objective.
0000794105-26-000106	RiskTextBlock	oef/2024q3	20251231	S000002564			ETFProspectus	Risk=IncomeRisk;	en-US	0	32767	3	1	1085	214		0	ETFProspectusMember_S000002564_IncomeRiskMember	 Income Risk . During periods of falling interest rates, the Funds income may decline. The income paid by shorter-term bonds is subject to a higher degree of fluctuation than the income paid by longer-term bonds.
0000794105-26-000106	RiskTextBlock	oef/2024q3	20251231	S000002561			ETFProspectus	Risk=CreditRisk;	en-US	0	32767	3	1	816	509		0	ETFProspectusMember_S000002561_CreditRiskMember	 Credit Risk . Credit risk refers to the chance that an issuer will default (fail to meet its credit obligations) or fail to make payments in a timely manner, which could result in a loss to the Fund. In addition, negative perceptions of an issuers ability to make payments can cause the price of a security to decline. While all debt securities are subject to credit risk to some extent, those with higher credit quality ratings generally pose less credit risk than those with lower credit quality ratings.
0000794105-26-000106	RiskTextBlock	oef/2024q3	20251231	S000002562			ETFProspectus	Risk=RiskNotInsuredDepositoryInstitution;	en-US	0	32767	3	1	262	162		0	ETFProspectusMember_S000002562_RiskNotInsuredDepositoryInstitutionMember	An investment in the Fund is not a deposit of a bank and is not insured or guaranteed by the Federal Deposit Insurance Corporation or any other government agency.
0000794105-26-000106	RiskTextBlock	oef/2024q3	20251231	S000002561			ETFProspectus	Risk=InvestingInBondMarketsRisk;	en-US	0	32767	3	1	1530	1149		0	ETFProspectusMember_S000002561_InvestingInBondMarketsRiskMember	 Investing in Bond Markets . The Fund may be impacted by the general condition of the bond markets and by factors that affect bonds and bond issuers. For example, as a general rule, bond prices and interest rates move in opposite directions. When interest rates rise, bond prices tend to fall, and when interest rates fall, bond prices tend to go up. Bond income also is affected by changes in interest rates. Interest rates can rise or fall for a number of reasons, including, but not limited to, central bank monetary policy, inflationary or deflationary pressures, and changes in general market and economic conditions. Changing interest rates, including, but not limited to, rates that fall below zero, could have unpredictable effects on the overall market and may expose the bond markets in particular to heightened volatility and potential illiquidity. The degree to which the Fund is impacted by certain bond market risks may vary based on factors disclosed in its principal investment strategies, such as the types of bonds in which it invests and the overall credit quality, average maturity, and/or average duration of its bond holdings.
0000794105-26-000106	HighestQuarterlyReturnLabel	oef/2024q3	20251231	S000002564			AdmiralProspectus	Class=C000007063;	en-US	0	32767	3	1	106	7		0	AdmiralProspectusMember_S000002564_C000007063	Highest
