0000794105-26-000106	LowestQuarterlyReturnLabel	oef/2024q3	20251231	S000002563			InvestorProspectus	Class=C000007060;	en-US	0	32767	3	1	105	6		0	InvestorProspectusMember_S000002563_C000007060	Lowest
0000794105-26-000106	BarChartLowestQuarterlyReturnDate	oef/2024q3	20251231	S000002563			InvestorProspectus	Class=C000007060;	en-US	0	32767	3	0	10	10		0	InvestorProspectusMember_S000002563_C000007060	2022-03-31
0000794105-26-000106	RiskTextBlock	oef/2024q3	20251231	S000002561			InstitutionalProspectus	Risk=IndexInvestingRisk;	en-US	0	32767	3	1	1832	1153		0	InstitutionalProspectusMember_S000002561_IndexInvestingRiskMember	 Index Investing . The Fund is subject to risks associated with index investing. Because the Fund generally seeks to track the performance of the Target Index regardless of how the Target Index is performing, the Funds performance may be lower than it would be if it were actively managed. Additionally, because the Fund does not hold all of the securities included in the Target Index, it is subject to the risk that the representative sample of securities selected by the advisor will, in the aggregate, vary from the investment profile of the full Target Index. The performance of the Funds investments, in the aggregate, may not match the investment performance of the Target Index. This risk, known as tracking error risk, may be heightened during times of increased market volatility or under other unusual market conditions. The Fund also could be negatively impacted by changes to the Target Index made by the index provider or by errors made by the index provider. Any gains, losses, or costs associated with or resulting from an error made by the index provider will generally be borne by the Fund and, as a result, the Funds shareholders.
0000794105-26-000106	RiskTextBlock	oef/2024q3	20251231	S000002563			InstitutionalProspectus	Risk=RiskLoseMoney;	en-US	0	32767	3	1	157	88		0	InstitutionalProspectusMember_S000002563_RiskLoseMoneyMember	As with any investment, an investment in the Fund could lose money over any time period.
