0000794105-26-000106	ExpenseExampleHeading	oef/2024q3	20251231	S000002564			ETFProspectus		en-US	0	32767	2	1	90	7		0	ETFProspectusMember_S000002564	Example
0000794105-26-000106	ExpenseExampleNarrativeTextBlock	oef/2024q3	20251231	S000002564			ETFProspectus		en-US	0	32767	2	1	966	400		0	ETFProspectusMember_S000002564	This example is intended to help you compare the cost of investing in the Fund with the cost of investing in other funds. The example assumes that you invest $10,000 in the Fund for the time periods indicated and then redeem all of your shares at the end of those periods. The example also assumes that your investment has a 5% return each year and that the Funds operating expenses remain the same.
